WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.230
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama writes about yesterday: “I visited the market.” What

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.027
should the next sentence add?

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:13.487
The answer is: A related detail about the event. Writing about experience includes

00:00:13.487 --> 00:00:14.352
related details.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.341
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama feels happy. Which sentence expresses the feeling?

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.360
The answer is: I feel happy.. A sentence can name a person’s feelings.
